WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Johannesburg, sedzani luvhondo lwonolwo lwa mithara mbili nga masiari.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Vhukati ha tshilimo ḓuvha ḽi swika kha 87°. Murunzi wa luvhondo u vha mupfufhi.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Musi vhuria vhu tshi sendela, ḓuvha ḽa masiari ḽi vha fhasi. Murunzi u lapfa u tshi ya tshipembe.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Vhukati ha vhuria ḓuvha ḽi swika kha 40°. Murunzi u lapfa hu ṱoḓaho u vha 2.4 m.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Hafha nga vhuria murunzi u tshanḓa tsha u ḽa, tshipembe. Ndima i re tshanḓa tsha u ṱhoha, devhula, i wana ḓuvha.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Ṱavhani zwimela zwipfufhi thungo ya devhula ya luvhondo lulapfu.
